# Every record of a run of EditProbe.tq, stopped once at /survey:/3 and resumed,
# then amended from the prompt at /survey:/5: step 1 was revoked and answered
# again, and the replay is asking step 2 afresh because it reads what step 1
# bound. The run waits at that prompt, so (live) is no longer the last position:
# steps 3 to 5 still stand beyond it.
#
# Positions are the records of the activations standing now, in document order.
# The superseded first answers to steps 1 and 2 and the Revoke are not, so they
# refuse every key. Down from step 2 crosses the prompt to step 3, and Down from
# the last record reaches (live); Up from (live) opens within the prompt's scope.
# Conventions are as in NetworkProbe.moves.
#
# origin                                            key         destination

/ Start                                             Up          (refused)
/ Start                                             Down        /survey: Begin
/ Start                                             Left        (refused)
/ Start                                             Right       /survey: Begin
/ Start                                             PageUp      (refused)
/ Start                                             PageDown    (refused)

/survey: Begin                                      Up          / Start
/survey: Begin                                      Down        /survey:/1 Begin
/survey: Begin                                      Left        / Start
/survey: Begin                                      Right       /survey:/1 Begin
/survey: Begin                                      PageUp      (refused)
/survey: Begin                                      PageDown    (refused)

